    "detailed_description": "Some are born with the power to control monsters\u2014genies. Feared, exploited, and hunted, these gifted few walk a lonely path. In the remote village of Listy, a boy named Fort hides this curse in silence. But when war crashes through his home and blood stains the streets, Fort is forced to embrace the truth of who\u2014and what\u2014he is. His fate is set in motion in a story of bonds, betrayal, and the cost of power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCommand monsters with the blood of a genie! Contract with creatures from four mighty tribes\u2014dragons, fairies, beasts, and vampires. Assign jobs, combine tribe and job traits, and build your fantastic team. Master turn-based battles and uncover the full strength of Fort's cursed legacy in this classic-style fantasy RPG!",
    "about_the_game": "Some are born with the power to control monsters\u2014genies. Feared, exploited, and hunted, these gifted few walk a lonely path. In the remote village of Listy, a boy named Fort hides this curse in silence. But when war crashes through his home and blood stains the streets, Fort is forced to embrace the truth of who\u2014and what\u2014he is. His fate is set in motion in a story of bonds, betrayal, and the cost of power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCommand monsters with the blood of a genie! Contract with creatures from four mighty tribes\u2014dragons, fairies, beasts, and vampires. Assign jobs, combine tribe and job traits, and build your fantastic team. Master turn-based battles and uncover the full strength of Fort's cursed legacy in this classic-style fantasy RPG!",
